2. `removeNamespace(namespaceName)`: Removes the namespace with the given name and all its contents.
3. `addVariable(namespaceName, variableName, value)`: Adds a variable with the given name and value to the specified namespace.
4. `getVariableValue(fullyQualifiedName)`: Retrieves the value of the variable with the given fully qualified name.

For example, if the following operations are performed:
```
NamespaceManager nsManager;
nsManager.addNamespace("Prova");
nsManager.addVariable("Prova", "var1", 10);
nsManager.addNamespace("Prova.Inner");
nsManager.addVariable("Prova.Inner", "var2", 20);
nsManager.getVariableValue("Prova.var1");
```
