The Fib4 sequence follows this rule:
fib4(n) -> fib4(n-1) + fib4(n-2) + fib4(n-3) + fib4(n-4) for n>3 and fib4(0)=0, fib4(1)=0, fib4(2)=2, fib4(3)=0.

