    list.remove(60); // No effect, no 60 in the list.
    list.remove(50); // Remove head.
    list.printList(); // Expected: 40 30 10 after removal.
    list.remove(10); // Remove tail. 
    list.printList(); // Expected: 40 30 after removal.
    list.remove(30); list.remove(40); // Remove all.
    list.printList(); // Expected: Line break only.
    return 0;
}
```
