int main()
{
    LRUCache ca(4);

    ca.refer(1);
    ca.refer(2);
    ca.refer(3);
    ca.refer(1);
    ca.refer(4);
    ca.refer(5);
    ca.display();

    return 0;
}
```
The output of `ca.display()` should be: `5 4 1 3`

