/*
Revise the poorly optimized and erroneous code provided below for an in-place reversal of a string using C++ without affecting the special characters. Identify the bugs and improvise the solution while keeping in mind the time and space complexity.
>>>reverseString("#$@!abcd1234")
"1234dcba!@#$"
>>>reverseString("*$&acd321@")
"123dca&$*"
