After the provider has been registered by the process, it can use the `EventWrite` or `EventWriteTransfer` APIs to write to the ETW session. When writing to the session is complete, `EventUnregister` API is used to close the provider's handle.

Remember to include the necessary headers (`#include <evntprov.h>`) and link to necessary library (`#pragma comment(lib, "advapi32.lib")`) to use these ETW APIs.

