namespace canbus {
namespace apollo {
// Other code here
}
}
)";
```
The function should return `"canbus::apollo"`.

Assume the following:
- The input code will be syntactically correct C++ code.
- The code may contain multiple namespace declarations.
- The code may contain comments and other C++ constructs, but the namespace will always be in the format `namespace <identifier> {`.

