The Fibonacci sequence is characterized by the fact that every number after the first two is the sum of the two preceding ones. A simple recursive approach can calculate Fibonacci sequence but it has exponential time complexity. 

An optimized way is to use dynamic programming that will work in O(n) time complexity and O(1) space complexity.

