of nums. The minimum sum should be calculated by adding up all the elements in the sub-matrix. You can assume that the input matrix is a 2D matrix with at least one row and one column.

Example
minSubMatrixSum({{2, 3, 4}, {1, 2, 4}, {-1, -1, -1}}) == -3
minSubMatrixSum({{-1, -2, -3}, {-4, -5, -6}}) == -21
*/
