colOutputs = {{1, 0, 1, 0}, {0, 1, 0, 1}};
colNextStates = {{2, 3, 1, 0}, {3, 2, 0, 1}};
colEncoder_n = 4;
max_states_col = 4;
den_llr_u = 0.7;
```
The function should return the computed LLR values as a vector:
```cpp
