```

Design your own class `EmployeesDatabase`, which should efficiently support the above operations. 

Consider implementing search trees, hashmaps, or other efficient data structures as part of your solution where necessary. Use OOP principles such as Encapsulation and apply error handling rules. Consider edge cases and test your program with a good set of inputs. 

